<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: shield jammer -->
  <DNX_ShieldJammer.label>护盾干扰装置</DNX_ShieldJammer.label>
  <!-- EN: An experimental electronic-warfare device. It projects a temporary disruption field over a selected area, repeatedly collapsing shield systems and marking suppressed targets with EMP particles. -->
  <DNX_ShieldJammer.description>一种实验性电子战装置。它会在选定区域投射临时干扰场，反复压垮护盾系统，并用电磁脉冲粒子标记被压制的目标。</DNX_ShieldJammer.description>
  <!-- EN: Select a target area. For 10 seconds, shields inside radius 10 are repeatedly suppressed and marked with EMP particles. -->
  <DNX_ShieldJammer.comps.CompShieldJammer.commandDesc>选择目标区域。10秒内，半径10格内的护盾会被反复压制，并被电磁脉冲粒子标记。</DNX_ShieldJammer.comps.CompShieldJammer.commandDesc>
  <!-- EN: Activate shield jammer -->
  <DNX_ShieldJammer.comps.CompShieldJammer.commandLabel>激活护盾干扰装置</DNX_ShieldJammer.comps.CompShieldJammer.commandLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: uplink support console -->
  <DNX_UplinkSupportConsole.label>上行链路支援控制台</DNX_UplinkSupportConsole.label>
  <!-- EN: An experimental direct fire-control uplink. Activating it lets the player guide remote support fire through a centered reticle interface. -->
  <DNX_UplinkSupportConsole.description>一种实验性直接火控上行链路。破解控制终端即可授权一次支援呼叫。激活后，玩家可以通过居中的瞄准界面引导远程支援火力。系统会在使用后重新锁定，并可在十天后再次破解。</DNX_UplinkSupportConsole.description>
  <DNX_UplinkSupportConsole.comps.CompHackable.notHackedInspectString>破解后可授权一次上行链路支援呼叫。</DNX_UplinkSupportConsole.comps.CompHackable.notHackedInspectString>
  <DNX_UplinkSupportConsole.comps.CompHackable.hackedInspectString>上行链路支援呼叫已授权。</DNX_UplinkSupportConsole.comps.CompHackable.hackedInspectString>
  <DNX_UplinkSupportConsole.comps.CompHackable.hackedMessage>{HACKER_labelShort} 已授权 {SUBJECT_labelNoParenthesisDef}。</DNX_UplinkSupportConsole.comps.CompHackable.hackedMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: uplink support missile -->
  <DNX_UplinkSupportMissile_Incoming.label>上行支援导弹</DNX_UplinkSupportMissile_Incoming.label>
  
</LanguageData>
